flowchart TD
    U[User request] --> I[Streamlit browser UI or CLI]
    I --> P[Query parser and input guardrails]
    P -->|Supported preferences| R[Content-based scorer and ranker]
    C[(Local songs.csv)] --> R
    R -->|Ranked catalog records and score reasons| G[Grounded response builder]
    G --> O[Recommendations and explanations]
    O --> U

    P -.->|Empty, unsupported, or invalid input| E[Actionable error]
    E --> I

    T[Automated pytest checks] -->|Parsing, ranking, grounding, guardrails| R
    H[Human reviewer] -->|Spot-check output against catalog| O
